      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Logit Style Extractor writes the medium and the style within it. The top node writes a style line from the entire image. The bottom node lists the style words that the prompt names.\n\nConnect an image and a prompt to one node, and it reads the style from the prompt, or from the image when the prompt names none. Put the style in front of each tile's tags so that every tile of an upscale keeps one style. The SD 1.5 face workflow does this."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Logit Style Extractor writes the medium and the style within it. The top node writes a style line from the entire image. The bottom node lists the style words that the prompt names.\n\nConnect an image and a prompt to one node, and it reads the style from the prompt, or from the image when the prompt names none. Put the style in front of each tile's tags so that every tile of an upscale keeps one style. The SD 1.5 face workflow does this."
      },
